#36174 made requestCert / rejectUnauthorized work on a per-serverName entry of Bun.serve({ tls: [...] }). The policy is applied when SNI selects that entry, so a client that doesn't select it doesn't get the policy. Omitting SNI entirely is enough, and the Host header still says whatever the client wants.
