This is the ultimate "Control Plane (JS) vs. Data Plane (Rust)" architecture. It turns Bun into a meta-compiler. It allows developers to write code with the ergonomics of TypeScript, but achieve the exact computational speed of native Rust, bypassing the JS engine's JIT completely for hot-path mathematical or memory operations.
