[TM] worker N ERROR  error: NameTooLong while resolving package
'data:application/javascript;base64,KGZ1bmN0aW9u…'  from 'bun:main'
Bun tries to resolve the data URL as a module specifier and hits a name/path length limit (NameTooLong). I confirmed it's purely length-driven: a tiny data-URL worker runs fine, but padding the source until the base64 URL is ~2.7 KB reliably reproduces NameTooLong. The ~2.6 KB ffjavascript blob is over the limit.
The failure is silent → hang. ffjavascript attaches only a "message" listener to each worker, never an "error" listener. So the worker never sends its INIT reply, the per-worker Deferred never resolves, Promise.all(initPromises) hangs forever, buildBn128 never returns → nothing logs, no exception.

