// thread is still inside pthread_cond_wait on it (the "wait-until-predicate-
// then-destroy" pattern). POSIX: destroying a cond var with a blocked waiter
// is UB. The owner destroys+frees right after broadcasting, WITHOUT proving
// every waiter has actually left cond_wait and dropped the mutex.
