Background: on macOS, posix_spawn file actions cannot wire an fd numbered >= OPEN_MAX (10240, hardcoded in sys/syslimits.h) into the child. This is independent of RLIMIT_NOFILE — it reproduces with a soft limit of 1,048,576.
