Hypothesis
Playwright's HAR writer streams response data through a Node-style Writable pipe to a tmpfile. The deadlock likely involves Bun's stream interop or its fs write semantics under a specific response pattern (Vercel's Next.js RSC streaming + heavy long-tail subresource requests).
