After analyzing the compiled output in dist.js, the root cause appears to be an incorrect execution/compilation order of the internal helper functions generated by the Bun bundler.
Bun bundler structures the compiled code like this:
class Child extends Base {
  constructor() {
    super();
    // BUG: This runs when instantiated, but the list of initializers (_init) is not populated yet!
    __runInitializers(_init, 5, this);  
  }
}
// The decorator is registered AFTER the class definition
