What is the problem this feature would solve?
Currently, Bun.Archive builds the entire archive in memory. To access the data, one must call .blob() or .arrayBuffer().
When archiving large directories, the process attempts to allocate memory for the entire resulting file at once. This causes the process to hang or crash (OOM) on large projects, making Bun.Archive unusable for creating large archives.
