Analysis
The issue appears to be that after sleep/wake:

Bun.Terminal opens /dev/ptmx (the PTY master)
But fails to properly call grantpt()/unlockpt()/ptsname() to allocate the slave
The shell spawns but has no valid TTY, so it exits immediately
The orphaned master FD is never cleaned up

