When using linker = "isolated" in a monorepo with multiple React versions, @types/react is hoisted to .bun/node_modules/@types/react pointing to a single version. A workspace specifying @types/react@18 will have its transitive dependencies (e.g., @ariakit/react) resolve type imports to @types/react@19, causing TypeScript errors—even though the runtime react package resolves correctly.
